Easiest way to rob a shop is to do it with a pickaxe (dwarfs often have them).
How to get it into a shop?
1) If you are fast (you are a samurai or other fast human, you have speed
   boots, you have drunk a potion of speed or zapped youself with wanf of
   speed monster) just drop it at the door of the shop and pick it up, the 
   shopkeeper is too slow to prevent you to enter the shop (try several times).
2) drop the pickaxe at the door, go insige and wait your pet to carry it in.
3) dig the way through the wall of the shop (you can do it!)
4) put the pickaxe in a bag and walk inside

And what's the best way to get out?
When you're digging your way through the floor, the shopkeeper often steals
your objects.  You can prevent that digging some pits around a corner of the 
shop and then dig through the corner.  Most of the shopkeepers don't touch
the pits (they're traps)

   |--------
   |@^......  <- You digging
   |^d.....   <- Your pet in a pit (will follow you)
   |@.......  <- Standing shopkeeper watching you robbering the shop

     Pic. 1   Robbering the shop

